    <string name="ced_intro">Write classifications like in Word: paste your text, then select lines and give them a style. Title = chapter, Subtitle = section, Sub-subtitle = one classification card. Deeper headings, lists and notes go inside a classification. Publish to see it in Classifications and in the patient picker.</string>
